{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43252","headline":"月夜梧桐叶上见寒露 · 戴察","name":"月夜梧桐叶上见寒露","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧疎桐叶上，月白露初团。\n滴沥清光满，荧煌素彩寒。\n风摇愁玉坠，枝动惜珠乾。\n气冷疑秋晚，声微觉夜阑。\n凝空流欲遍，润物净宜看。\n莫厌窥临倦，将曦聚更难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}